{"description":"HeyOrca is bringing Toronto’s social media marketing community together for one big day of learning, connecting, and sharing ideas with 400+ marketers.\n\nFeaturing marketers from Canva, beehiiv, CrowdRiff, Parkdale Community Food Bank, and more, the Summit will cover social media, creator marketing, content strategy, B2B social, non-profit social strategy, community building, and more.\nThroughout the day, you'll hear from marketers who are doing the work every day as they break down real campaigns, practical strategies, experiments, and lessons you can apply to your own work.\nCheck out our speakers and agenda at heyorca.com/toronto-summit.\n\nBetween sessions, you'll have plenty of opportunities to connect with fellow social media marketers, visit interactive community activations, and experience everything the Summit has to offer.\n\nCome ready to learn from other marketers, make new connections, and walk away with ideas you'll actually be excited to try.\n\nPlease note that tickets with a lunch add-on close on Wednesday, October 7; tickets without lunch close on Tuesday, October 13. Get all the details at heyorca.com/toronto-summit.\nAny questions? Email natalie@heyorca.com 🐳","organizer":"HeyOrca IRL and virtual events"}